.\" Man page for improv-gui.
.TH IMPROV-GUI 1 "2026-10-15" "improv 0.8.1" "Improv Manual"
.SH NAME
improv-gui \- desktop workspace for Improv models
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B improv-gui
.RI [ model ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B improv-gui
opens a model in a NeXTSTEP-style workspace: an application menu, one
worksheet window per matrix, and a model browser. Pivot by dragging a
category tile between a worksheet's strips; edit an input cell by
double-clicking it; add a formula by typing
.I Name = formula
on the last line of a worksheet's formula list. Every change is saved as it
is made. Without an argument the model is in memory only.
.PP
A model is a store file made by
.BR improv (1),
or a Postgres model URL,
.BI postgres:// user @ host / db ?model= name\fR.

.SH KEYS
Key equivalents take Ctrl (Cmd on macOS):
.BR s " save, " z " undo, " Z " or " y " redo, " h " hide, " q " quit."
In a grid: arrows or
.B hjkl
move, Shift+arrows select a range (the status bar shows its sum), Enter or
F2 edits,
.BR [ " and " ]
page,
.B n
cycles the measure.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MENTAT_MMAP_SIZE
As for
.BR improv (1).
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
improv-gui sample.db
improv-gui 'postgres://me@127.0.0.1/sales?sslmode=disable&model=plan'
.fi
.SH AUTHOR
Greg Burd <greg@burd.me>
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR improv (1),
.BR improv-tui (1),
.BR improv-server (1).
